Textbook: Introduction to Topological Manifolds by John M. Lee, 2nd Edition, 2011, Springer, ISBN-13:
978-1441979391. 

Description: Topological spaces. Metric spaces. Compactness, local compactness. Product and quotient
topology. Separation axioms. Connectedness. Function spaces. Fundamental group and covering spaces. 

